    "text": "During the week beginning Monday, Dec. 15, these former South Delaware County area high school athletes will be in action.\nAkhir Keys\nAlbright Lions\nGuard\nJunior\n6′3″ 175\nChichester High School\nHometown: Marcus Hook\nNext Game: vs. Kean Cougars, Tuesday, Dec. 16, 6 p.m.\nAva Possenti\nUrsinus Bears\nGuard\nSenior\n5′6″\nGarnet Valley High School\nHometown: Garnet Valley\nNext Game: vs. Fairleigh Dickinson Knights, Saturday, Dec. 20, 1 p.m.\nDamiyae Moyet\nEastern Eagles\nGuard\nSenior\n5′7″\nChichester High School\nHometown: Chester\nNext Game: vs. Susquehanna Riverhawks, Tuesday, Dec. 16, 6 p.m.\nEmily Olsen\nRandolph-Macon Yellow Jackets\nForward\nSophomore\n6′0″\nGarnet Valley High School\nHometown: Garnet Valley\nNext Game: vs. Catholic Cardinals, Tuesday, Dec. 16, 4 p.m.",
